      "html": "\n    <div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:34px;padding:38px 40px;margin-top:30px;\"><div style=\"font-size:52px;font-weight:800;color:#0A0A0A;text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;\">Förklaring 1/2</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);text-align:center;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:30px;\">Du känner bara till de tre synliga sidorna av varje tärning. Varje symbol finns på exakt en sida, aldrig flera. Vrid tärning 1 ett kvarts varv i taget tills den ligger likadant som tärning 2. Då kan du jämföra. Okända sidor är tomma och kan aldrig motbevisa något.</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:26px;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"width:300px;height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 262 262\" width=\"262\" height=\"262\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><polygon points=\"147.6,112.2 42.7,81.0 114.4,35.4 219.3,66.6\" fill=\"#dad5c7\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"219.3,181.0 147.6,226.6 147.6,112.2 219.3,66.6\" fill=\"#6c6962\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"147.6,226.6 42.7,195.4 42.7,81.0 147.6,112.2\" fill=\"#b1ada1\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"207.8,94.5 207.8,167.7 197.8,174.1 197.8,146.6 159.0,171.3 159.0,153.0 197.8,128.3 197.8,100.9\" fill=\"#15140f\"/><polygon points=\"95.1,195.0 63.7,155.9 63.7,105.5 126.6,124.3 126.6,174.6\" fill=\"#15140f\"/><polygon points=\"145.9,95.6 78.8,75.7 154.0,59.2\" fill=\"#15140f\"/></svg></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:27px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);\">Tärning 1</div>\n    </div><div style=\"font-size:52px;font-weight:800;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.50);\">→</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:colu